              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='21858' id='14' type-v2='text' w='54298' x='400' y='571'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>Forest Fire Analysis: Predicted Burned Area in Northeast Portugal</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Phase 2 TEPP group project by Amir Benston, Lofinda B. Beynis and Palo Becerra, August 2026. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#f1ce63' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='21858' id='15' type-v2='text' w='34701' x='54698' y='571'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10' italic='true'>The purpose of this study was to build a model that could predict </run>
                  <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10' italic='true'>what caused some fires to burn more area than others.</run>
                  <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='12'>The FWI system rating was the best metric for predicting burned area, </run>
                  <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='12'> beating out the raw feature variables.</run>
                  <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='12'>Even after applying clusters (k=3) to our best model(Model G),</run>
                  <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='12'>we were only able to create a weak regression model.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#edc948' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='21858' id='27' type-v2='text' w='10201' x='89399' y='571'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Sources:</run>
                  <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run auto-url='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/162/forest+fires&amp;quot;'>https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/162/forest+fires</run>
